@@ -1 +1,16 @@
 # ledgerstat
+
+Spending reports from bank-export CSV files (`date,merchant,category,amount`).
+
+## Usage
+
+```
+python3 -m ledgerstat categories FILE... [--format table|json|csv] [--from DATE] [--to DATE] [--strict]
+python3 -m ledgerstat monthly FILE...
+python3 -m ledgerstat merchants FILE... --top 10
+python3 -m ledgerstat budget FILE... --config budgets.toml [--alerts-only]
+```
+
+Exit codes: 0 ok, 1 invalid rows skipped, 2 fatal error, 3 a budget is exceeded.
+
+Run the tests with `python3 -m unittest discover`.
